            { q: "What is a materialized view in a data warehouse?", opts: ["A virtual table", "A precomputed query result stored as a table — trading storage for query speed on expensive aggregations", "A dashboard cache", "A real-time view"], a: 1, exp: "Materialized views precompute expensive aggregations. Daily sales by region calculated once and stored — queries hit the materialized view instead of recomputing." }
