            { q: "What is ELT vs ETL?", opts: ["Same process, different names", "ETL: transform before loading to warehouse; ELT: load raw data first, transform within the warehouse using its compute power", "ELT is outdated", "ETL is cloud-only"], a: 1, exp: "Cloud warehouses (BigQuery, Snowflake) have cheap compute. ELT loads raw data then transforms with SQL/dbt inside the warehouse — more flexible and cloud-native than ETL." }
